{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52593","headline":"五言登禅定阁一首 · 张栖贞","name":"五言登禅定阁一首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹿苑传金地，龙宫出铁围。\n阁里山河近，楼上落星稀。\n独园登彼岸，双树遂忘归。\n具（疑应作「贝」）叶含峯入，芦花逐鴈飞。\n云{扌卧}拟留盖，萝悬似拂衣。\n言倍列棘赏，同赴握兰期。\n禅林当月路，更似偶仙扉。\n（日本藏唐抄本《唐诗卷》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张栖贞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52593.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52593","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}